      <h2 id="nw-anp-differences-networkpolicy_network-policy-apis" class="group scroll-mt-20">Key differences between AdminNetworkPolicy and NetworkPolicy custom resources<a href="#nw-anp-differences-networkpolicy_network-policy-apis" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">To choose the right network policy API for your cluster or namespace in OpenShift Container Platform, you can compare <code>AdminNetworkPolicy</code> and <code>NetworkPolicy</code> CRs across scope, rule actions, precedence, and peer options. </p>
      <p>The following reference table highlights differences in who can apply policies, how traffic is allowed or denied, and how OVN-Kubernetes evaluates each API.</p>
